//! # Internal Voice System
//!
//! Audio representation of system internal communication.
//! Creates the experience of hearing other alters as whispers, thoughts, and impulses.
//!
//! ## Voice Types
//!
//! - **Whispers**: Quiet background chatter from non-fronting alters
//! - **Interjections**: Sudden comments from specific alters
//! - **Presence**: Subtle audio signature when an alter is stirring
//! - **Echoes**: Fragmented memories/flashbacks as audio
//!
//! ## Spatial Design
//!
//! Voices are positioned in headspace:
//! - Fronting alter: Center
//! - Co-conscious: Slightly off-center
//! - Nearby alters: Left/right periphery
//! - Distant alters: Faint, echoing

use super::{AudioAsset, AudioChannel, AudioId};
use crate::system::{PluralSystem, Alter, AlterState};
use std::collections::HashMap;

